{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/4fb3aa50c7b756bc98da6540bd8897b3.avif?t=1771104773\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras_big/4fb3aa50c7b756bc98da6540bd8897b3.webp?t=1771104773 width=1560 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engines of Destruction is a mech simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of pilot, customise your mechs, fight in PvP/PvE battles, and operate a fully interactive cockpit in VR or on desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/03a65a0df4e75ab0b6b96087f5f5c332.poster.avif?t=1771104773\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/03a65a0df4e75ab0b6b96087f5f5c332.webm?t=1771104773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/03a65a0df4e75ab0b6b96087f5f5c332.mp4?t=1771104773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/9ff6cff0a0560147e8a48949272096e0.avif?t=1771104773\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras_big/9ff6cff0a0560147e8a48949272096e0.webp?t=1771104773 width=1560 height=198 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Pilot enormous mechs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/0f4d28c47fe53f31164f6226ec3bb2f8.poster.avif?t=1771104773\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/0f4d28c47fe53f31164f6226ec3bb2f8.webm?t=1771104773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/0f4d28c47fe53f31164f6226ec3bb2f8.mp4?t=1771104773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every system of the mech is simulated, the reactor, radar, heat, armour weak-spots, weapons, movement and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the cockpit, every switch, button, and screen serves a purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These systems work together to create a unique game, delivering the fantasy of mech combat alongside realistic mechanics inspired by the flight simulation genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Mech Building &amp; Visual Customisation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/b8a77ce77b0b53d961ef83578d089da2.poster.avif?t=1771104773\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/b8a77ce77b0b53d961ef83578d089da2.webm?t=1771104773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design the perfect mech for your playstyle. Swap the weapons, chassis, armour-packages, movement-kits, reactors, motors, drones &amp; more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After preparing your setup, dive into the visual customisation. Add decals, edit the camouflage, change colours for each mech region, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- PvP &amp; PvE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/bef57433bb05f01d7fbaf96dbe3a744f.poster.avif?t=1771104773\" width=1170 height=680 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/bef57433bb05f01d7fbaf96dbe3a744f.webm?t=1771104773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/bef57433bb05f01d7fbaf96dbe3a744f.mp4?t=1771104773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with or against others in player vs player &amp; co-op modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP engagements range from sprawling 20 player team battles to brutal 2v2 arena matches, and feature a variety of different objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op &quot;Contracts&quot; are a group of objective based missions played against AI enemies, that can be taken on solo or with a group of friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Mission Creator &amp; Mod Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Engines of Destruction, we create the game for the players.\u00a0It's our number one aim to make something fun for everyone, a key part of that is to give out the tools for playing EOD in any way you can imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve this we will be releasing:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community hosted server support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission creation tools (for co-op/PvP)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modding tools  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/0a9668c19a0204963fa766ebdea182f4.avif?t=1771104773\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras_big/0a9668c19a0204963fa766ebdea182f4.webp?t=1771104773 width=1560 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engines of Destruction takes place between 2036-2040 in the era known as 'post-shatter', named after a terrible calamity that befell the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this era powerful corporations, city states and military groups vie for power, resources and survival.\u00a0Many areas exist in a tentative peace, but armed conflict is far from rare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take the role of a pilot, recently hired into a group of freelancers who regularly take on faction contract work. Eager up your reputation as a pilot, and receive the associated benefits, you begin taking on every job you can.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1937070?t=1771104773","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/752dafc1caa431b1c103d2afb8400ff7a2697fb7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771104773","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/6784a091fd87c1f245916fc5d883fcedbb14cd21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771104773","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/6784a091fd87c1f245916fc5d883fcedbb14cd21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771104773","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Violence, No depicition of Blood/Gore"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span c